        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 211.63,
          "end": 214.323,
          "en": "and you can just use them as well, if you want to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 215.23,
          "end": 219.36,
          "en": "So now with that file added styles.js in a constants folder",
