        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 227.59,
          "end": 230.183,
          "en": "to style our tabs headers here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 231.41,
          "end": 235.36,
          "en": "And for this, I will start with my header style property,",
